  "description": "MongoODM.Net is a .NET Object-Document Mapping (ODM) library designed to simplify the interaction between .NET applications and MongoDB databases. It provides a seamless way to map .NET objects to MongoDB documents, abstracting away the complexities of raw MongoDB queries and offering a more intuitive API for CRUD operations.",
